  "description": "\"Hire me. Business will boom if you hire someone with a face like mine.\"     \n\nA suspicious new employee arrives at a shabby pub. He lives in a tiny studio apartment, yet he carries himself like a prince who owns the world. Why is he so confident despite constantly making trivial mistakes? Ji-woo, the pub manager, can't help but be bothered by him.      \n\n\"Noona, did you see that guy's car? It's a supercar worth over a billion won.\"      \n\nAs expected, he's strange and suspicious. Ji-woo doesn't want to admit she's attracted to him, but he keeps provoking her with his playful tone. \n\n\"I told you, everything I have is on the larger side.\"     \n\"How could you possibly understand a body that even I don't fully understand?\"    \n\nThen, one day, he kisses her with a gaze of unfathomable depth. \n\n\"Date me for a month. Properly.\" \n\nA strange secret romance begins with a suspicious man. Will she be able to end it safely after a month?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852337), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14399673)",
